WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.355 --> 00:00:02.190
MEREDITH KNOWLES: Land
O'Lakes is a customer

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.880
who collects massive
amounts of data

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.920
from farmers-- soil type,
rainfall, fertilizer amounts,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.490
seed type, things like that.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.900
But they didn't have a way
to bring that data together

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.170
to gain insight from it.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.330
We were able to, over a
very short amount of time,

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.690
write an application
for them that pulled

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:25.090
that data into BigQuery
using Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:29.070
And so by doing that across
millions of acres of farmland,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:33.760
farmers are being able to grow
more food with less input, less

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.420
resources, which is super
important for companies who

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.410
are looking to be more efficient
in the amount of resources

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.000
that they use to grow food.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.679
And it also helps them, over
time, increase their crop yield

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.970
to feed our growing population.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:51.320
[MUSIC PLAYING]

